  "look": "Round, slightly flattened (h ≈ 0.8 d), saturated red-orange skin with soft natural gloss; 5–6 thin curling sepals and a short thick stem; 5–6 mm wall with a lighter inner layer, 7 large unequal chambers with thin septa, narrow pale columella, pale fibrous placenta fanning into each chamber with a row of large yellow teardrop seeds along its edge, bright translucent red-orange gel outside the seeds. See reference.md.",
